{"id":"lane-dff-review","parent":"done-flip-flake","ord":"a1","title":"review: pi","done":"2026-08-31T09:54:51-04:00","started":"2026-08-31T09:50:22-04:00","worked":1838,"after":["lane-dff-implement"],"created":"2026-08-31T08:15:25-04:00","changed":"2026-08-31T09:54:51-04:00","custom":{"musts":"0","reviewer":"agent-pi","shoulds":"1","terminal":"dd83a1ff","verdict":"APPROVE at 8f1e5ce8 — cause verified in code (the held reading wears the old page's identity; both new predicates are swap detectors, not relocated sleeps), coverage across all ~70 flip sites checked, NO product race (test-unique synchronization), no timeout widened. SHOULD: preferences_steps.ts:347,353,413 keep unscoped locators — ride flipOfAddressed. NIT ×2: the outline-sibling click keeps the rAF shape; the cold-loads claim silently rests on openNode. Comment 5479248944.","verdict-followup":"round 2 at 24157494: confirmed — the SHOULD rides flipOfAddressed with the correct intersection combinator, all 7 outline-click sites re-walked safe under the stronger wait, the cold-load claim's openNode chain verified, nothing else moved (no timeouts, no product files, the no-op merge accurate). Comment 5479364984."}}
